The API returns every explicit price directive in commodity, date, and source order.

========== API ==========

prices({ mode: 'directives' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
commodity UNUSED
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-02 FUND 12 SEK ; first
P 2024-01-01 UNUSED 4 SEK ; unused
P 2024-01-02 FUND 13 SEK ; corrected

2024-01-03 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {10 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-02",
    "baseCommodity": "FUND",
    "quoteQuantity": "12",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": "first"
  },
  {
    "date": "2024-01-02",
    "baseCommodity": "FUND",
    "quoteQuantity": "13",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": "corrected"
  },
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "baseCommodity": "UNUSED",
    "quoteQuantity": "4",
    "quoteCommodity": "SEK",
    "comment": "unused"
  }
]
